spice
* Voltage Source
Vx 1 0 DC Vx

* Resistors
Rro2 2 7 ro2
Rro1 4 3 ro1

* Controlled Current Sources (g_m V_sg)
Gsg2 2 3 Vsg2 gm
Gsg1 5 3 Vsg1 gm

* Nodes
* 1 - Vx positive terminal
* 2 - Node between Rro2 and Gsg2
* 3 - Common node for Gsg2, Gsg1, and S1 to ground connection
* 4 - Node between Rro1 and Gsg1
* 5 - Node between Gsg1 and Vsg1
* 7 - Node between Rro2 and S2 to ground connection